From fa75db8b669d7f9816ab1b1cfb168d9a09007d2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abhishek Kekane <akekane@redhat.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 07:41:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Block restricted hosts when adding HTTP image locations

Apply import_filtering_opts to HTTP(S) locations and validate
the URI before contacting the backend, so location add cannot
SSRF glance-api into loopback or link-local targets.

Depends-On: https://review.opendev.org/c/openstack/tempest/+/1003560

Closes-Bug: #2161330
SecurityImpact

Assisted-By: Cursor (claude-4.5-sonnet)
Change-Id: Iff9793480ad6da44490afc6c686771bd85908a5a
Signed-off-by: Abhishek Kekane <akekane@redhat.com>
Signed-off-by: Brian Rosmaita <rosmaita.fossdev@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 232b1fb65346b2cca9a7be4456e3a497c2e87875)
Conflicts:
  glance/common/store_utils.py
